<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Drowse</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 25)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast drowse &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster waves a finger before the target's eyes and utters 'Shonashi', 
and the target grows drowsy: their reflexes slow, and in a fight they 
strike more slowly. It slows harder than the slow spell, but it doesn't 
last long: from a quarter of a minute up to a little over a minute, the 
better your spell.
</p><p>It takes the place of any haste, quicken or slow already on the target. 
The target resists with their mind, and the spell may fail; either way, 
casting it makes the target attack you. It can be cast while fighting, and 
no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
